    "Five months ago",
    "It seems to me",
    "that I have",
    "aged very much",
    "since that",
    "bitter day; now",
    "I must rely on",
    "myself in diffi-",
    "culties, while be-",
    "fore I had al-",
    "-ways carried",
    "everything to him.",
    "The vividness with",
    "which I can",
    "recall his words",
    "and actions is",
    "sometimes really",
    "startling."
   ],
